-- 2026-11-15: GUIDE respite is 19 four-hour visits a year (76 hours), not 20. CMS PY 2026: $2,625 cap counted at $138 per in-home 4-hour unit.
-- Only Cara's K106 answer changes, and only when it still differs. Same text as supabase/knowledge/cara-2026-10-27.mjs.
update public.kb_items set answer = 'The Medicare program we work with is GUIDE, for people living with dementia at home. Families further along in the disease can get 19 four-hour respite visits a year (76 hours), billed to Medicare. Medicare decides who qualifies. Caring Companions is an approved GUIDE respite provider in southwest Missouri. Call (417) 234-8494 and we will check eligibility with you.',
  verified_on = '2026-11-15', verified_by = 'Samantha 11-15: GUIDE respite is 19 visits (CMS PY 2026)'
  where id = 'K106' and answer is distinct from 'The Medicare program we work with is GUIDE, for people living with dementia at home. Families further along in the disease can get 19 four-hour respite visits a year (76 hours), billed to Medicare. Medicare decides who qualifies. Caring Companions is an approved GUIDE respite provider in southwest Missouri. Call (417) 234-8494 and we will check eligibility with you.';
